    "note": [
        {
            "structuredValue": [],
            "parallelValue": [],
            "groupedValue": [],
            "value": "This ethnography chronicles a shift in the presentation of hero characters within professional wrestling.  After a brief history of professional wrestling, content analysis and fan interviews demonstrate a change in how hero characters are being portrayed within the unique form of entertainment. Driving forces behind this shift and applications to other areas of society are discussed.",
